    "description": "Section heading on the settings screen, above widgets, third-party integrations and the MCP server. Means 'links to other systems', not network connectivity. Keep under ~20 chars.",
    "maxLength": 40
  },
  "settingsMergedChatsTitle": "Merged chats",
