    "description": "Title of a settings row that opens a dialog with the app's version, build details and open-source licences. 'Sennit' is the app name and is never translated. Keep under ~24 chars."
  },
  "settingsAboutSubtitle": "Version, build details and licences",
  "@settingsAboutSubtitle": {
    "description": "One-line subtitle under 'About Sennit'. 'Build details' are the commit and build date of test builds; 'licences' are the open-source licences of the libraries the app uses. Keep under ~60 chars."
