  "smsRoleSubtitle": "Android gives it all at once. The default app receives every incoming message, is the only app allowed to write to the phone''s message store, and answers the \"send a message\" action from your contacts and dialler. Sennit writes what it receives and sends into that same store, so switching back to another app leaves your history where it was.",
