    "description": "Shown when the system refused to show its default-SMS-app dialog at all — the role is missing from this ROM, or the device has no telephony. Must not read as if the user declined: they were never asked, so avoid the 'nothing changed' phrasing used for a decline. 'Sennit' is the app's name."
