  "smsRcsWithGoogleMessages": "Google Messages holds the messaging role, so this phone has RCS. Sennit cannot take that over: Android has no RCS API for a third-party app — RCS is Google Messages talking to Google''s network, and only while it is the default. Making Sennit your SMS app would turn RCS off for the whole phone and drop those conversations back to SMS and MMS.",
